  "size": 14,
  "items": [
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "9bb0486b00bf5efc276279d97ba7ec5f4594c6a0060b118dd111a7c7c5823728",
      "line": 5157,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua",
      "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*Before you stands a beautiful woman clad in shining golden armour*#WHITE#\nStop! You are clearly a stranger! Where do you come from? The Gates of Morning are the last bastion of freedom in these lands, so who are you? A spy?",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*在你面前站着一位穿着金光闪闪铠甲的美丽女士。*#WHITE#\n站住！陌生人！你是从哪里来的？晨曦之门是这块大陆最后的自由圣地，你到底是谁？你是一个间谍么？",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "9bb0486b00bf5efc276279d97ba7ec5f4594c6a0060b118dd111a7c7c5823728"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "c9ca3948c3c632fd2c5f827a73f773e6dd2fd14517e02429475cc423d66c51ee",
      "line": 5160,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua",
      "source": "My lady, I am indeed a stranger in these lands. I come from the west, from Maj'Eyal.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "我的女士，没错对于这个大陆来说我的确是一个陌生人，我来自西方，马基·埃亚尔。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "c9ca3948c3c632fd2c5f827a73f773e6dd2fd14517e02429475cc423d66c51ee"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "7811bf7c6cbc42bfe7e15d56cb891b4f36fcffb44e69acd8557f9660ba5c403d",
      "line": 5161,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua",
      "source": "Sorry, I have to go!",
      "source_tag": "chat_gates-of-morning-welcome",
      "special": null,
      "target": "抱歉，我要走了！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "7811bf7c6cbc42bfe7e15d56cb891b4f36fcffb44e69acd8557f9660ba5c403d"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "8ed554362c9340a788183db88828f4447f1b7b2531486fa7f338931b5a59a06f",
      "line": 5162,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua",
      "source": "Maj'Eyal! For many years have we tried to contact your people. We always failed.\nIn any event, what is your purpose here?",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "马基·埃亚尔！我们的人民尝试了很多年与你们取得联系，但都失败了。\n不管怎样，你来这里是干什么的？",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "8ed554362c9340a788183db88828f4447f1b7b2531486fa7f338931b5a59a06f"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "568eeeef8b7a43f727213ddfbd49c659f62f1cde67b0c2886538f84d85d418a8",
      "line": 5165,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua",
      "source": "It seems that I am stranded in these unfamiliar lands. #LIGHT_GREEN#*Tell her about your hunt for orcs and your encounter with Fillarel.*#WHITE#",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "好像我在这片陌生的土地上被困住了。#LIGHT_GREEN#*告诉她关于你追杀兽人并遭遇了菲拉瑞尔的事。*#WHITE#",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "568eeeef8b7a43f727213ddfbd49c659f62f1cde67b0c2886538f84d85d418a8"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "c33804f07a246ea7059bbf1dfea726c5a97551566a2435c7d5c1eb0006827861",
      "line": 5166,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua",
      "source": "Sun Paladins? What do you mean? We know of no such thing where I come from.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "太阳骑士？你是什么意思？在我的家乡，我们没听说过这种东西。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "c33804f07a246ea7059bbf1dfea726c5a97551566a2435c7d5c1eb0006827861"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "f3b621fb0176ce8142b5d66d5c83ae8e68589edf7227602f7b0138730ad9dff4",
      "line": 5167,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua",
      "source": "We are the mighty warriors of the Sunwall, channeling the power of the Sun and merging it with martial training.\nFor hundreds of years, we stood between the Orc Pride and the free people. Our numbers are diminishing, but we will stand firm until our last breath.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "我们是太阳堡垒里强大的战士，汲取太阳的力量，并将其注入到我们的军事训练中。\n数百年来，我们一直为了人民的自由与兽人战斗，我们的成员人数在不断减少，不过我们会战斗至最后一刻。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "f3b621fb0176ce8142b5d66d5c83ae8e68589edf7227602f7b0138730ad9dff4"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "6a7dc267885405b9ae43f0a8df941b63e22c8e7d236eb7759708f0c19eb614b0",
      "line": 5170,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua",
      "source": "You have a noble spirit, my lady.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "你的精神十分高贵，我的女士。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "6a7dc267885405b9ae43f0a8df941b63e22c8e7d236eb7759708f0c19eb614b0"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "061ccceab1be0376abec13a27422a8113508eacc56369291ce57ea00e1af382f",
      "line": 5171,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua",
      "source": "Orcs! Ah! Well then this is your lucky day. This whole continent is swarming with Orcs. They have united as the Orc Pride and, according to rumour, their masters are powerful.\nThey roam the lands freely, ever assaulting us.\n@playername@, you have helped one of ours. I grant you access to the Gates of Morning and name you friend of the Sunwall.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "兽人！啊！那你非常走运，这个大陆到处都是兽人，他们组成了兽人部落，有传言，他们的首领非常强大。\n他们在这片大陆上四处劫掠，不断袭击我们。\n@playername@，你已经帮了我们一个忙了，欢迎你来到晨曦之门，你是我们太阳堡垒的朋友。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "061ccceab1be0376abec13a27422a8113508eacc56369291ce57ea00e1af382f"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "4b09f88fe9474cfdc577019c411bc46d576936d0be4005a7f284ba79fc4fe6c5",
      "line": 5176,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua",
      "source": "Thank you, my lady.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "谢谢你，我的女士。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "4b09f88fe9474cfdc577019c411bc46d576936d0be4005a7f284ba79fc4fe6c5"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "91b89175eb5f2b1329d38a5ed9711c9dbc4eb89872218264ec1673427b1a260c",
      "line": 5181,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/golbug-explains.lua",
      "source": "#VIOLET#*As you open the door you notice a huge orc in the distance, covered in both flames and ice.*#LAST#\n@playerdescriptor.race@! You should never have come! Your doom awaits!\nThe Orc Pride will never yield to anybody! They have their precious and there is nothing you can do.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "#VIOLET#*当你打开门，你注意到远处一个巨大的兽人，同时被冰与火包围着。*\n#LAST#@playerdescriptor.race@！你不应该来这里！你的死期到了！\n兽人部落不会为任何人让步！他们有他们珍视的东西，你什么也做不了！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "91b89175eb5f2b1329d38a5ed9711c9dbc4eb89872218264ec1673427b1a260c"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "fc993f42eda1cd3b959826def7a9362cb6681616dbd1c08397b8f2e8e205ba43",
      "line": 5186,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/golbug-explains.lua",
      "source": "The Orc Pride obeys a master? I see... 'pride' indeed!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "整个兽人部落会服从一个主人？我明白了……还真是“骄傲”啊！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "fc993f42eda1cd3b959826def7a9362cb6681616dbd1c08397b8f2e8e205ba43"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "4f00ca3de3117971a1a6c20fad8004bfaaaedab4c383a13122e818e6032dc875",
      "line": 5187,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/golbug-explains.lua",
      "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#[Attack]",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#[攻击]",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "4f00ca3de3117971a1a6c20fad8004bfaaaedab4c383a13122e818e6032dc875"
    },
    {
      "args_order": null,
      "component": "tome",
      "entry_id": "3ecdf033ce4cea4f94f39bbdf9f2d780363db342f70bae891c322683ab0917c1",
      "line": 5188,
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/golbug-explains.lua",
      "source": "The Pride chooses its allies. It has no master! ATTACK!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "special": null,
      "target": "部落只会选择自己的盟友，我们从不屈服于人！攻击！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "3ecdf033ce4cea4f94f39bbdf9f2d780363db342f70bae891c322683ab0917c1"
    }
  ]
}
